golden addresses bin-display unit index i at iAddArrayTFT[i] (BinDisplay/MyBinDisp.cpp :790; every TFT frame and reply check reads it forward, nothing searches it backwards): 0x20 Loader, 0x21 Empty, 0x22 Color, 0x23 Auto1, 0x24 Auto2, 0x25 Auto3 ... The HT9050's five TFT units answer at 0x20..0x24 (measured on COM1 9600 with golden ReadVersion_TFT) and are wired Loader / Auto1 / Auto2 / Auto3 / Empty, no Color unit. New W906_BinDispTftAddrHt9050_St02 (end of BinDisplay/BinDispBringUp_St02.cpp; called once from W906_BinDispSystemModularBoot_St02 on the existing line after InstallColorBinDisplay, forward declaration on the function's own line -- no line moves): on Type_HT9050 with NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE 4 sets Empty=0x24, Auto1=0x21, Auto2=0x22, Auto3=0x23, Color=0x25 (no unit there: golden's GetStatus times it out and marks it not installed; index 2 is outside golden's i>=3 not-installed error check). Other machines and other indexes: golden. One [TFT9050] stdout line.

Measured (release, idle, 210 s): binsel.disp.inst = 1 1 0 1 1 1 (Loader, Empty, Auto1, Auto2, Auto3 installed; Color not). Machine ini (pushed by the machine_params snapshot): NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE 4, [NUMBER_PANEL] / [NUMBER_PANEL2] COM_PORT COM1 (backup .bak_tft_20261006_154508). WORKLOG item 136 (also records cpp d0e060b, the IDX1203 stop-line fix).

o2 build 0 errors; bin-display ctests 7/7 pass; Debug and release wb_serve rebuilt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 BinDisplay/BinDispBringUp_St02.cpp | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 docs/WORKLOG_MACHINE.md            |  1 +
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/BinDisplay/BinDispBringUp_St02.cpp b/BinDisplay/BinDispBringUp_St02.cpp
index 5ff2d4d..6b0ef23 100644
--- a/BinDisplay/BinDispBringUp_St02.cpp
+++ b/BinDisplay/BinDispBringUp_St02.cpp
@@ -593,7 +593,7 @@ void TMyBinDispCtrl::Timer1Timer(TObject * /*Sender*/)
 // [W906] only the bin-display half: the :1541 MyGem=new HT9045Gem half is NOT run here (wb_serve never calls
 // SystemModularInitial, so it has no HT9045Gem today; changing that is a SECS decision, not this card's).
 //------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-void W906_BinDispSystemModularBoot_St02()
+void W906_BinDispTftAddrHt9050_St02();  void W906_BinDispSystemModularBoot_St02()   //AI(W906-TFT9050) 20261006: forward declaration, same line
 {
     if(NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE==3 ||
        NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE==4)                                                    //Sam 20240604 : 新增 BinDisplay TFT
@@ -602,7 +602,7 @@ void W906_BinDispSystemModularBoot_St02()
             DataModule3=new TDataModule3(NULL);                                 // golden HT9045.cpp:212
         if(HSys.BinDisCtrl==NULL)                                               // once (golden: one HSys ctor)
             (HSys.*SysModAccess_St02::InstallMember())(NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE);      // golden :1545 InstallColorBinDisplay(NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE); [W906] (9)
-        if(HSys.BinDisCtrl!=NULL && HSys.BinDisCtrl->slBinDispLog!=NULL)
+        W906_BinDispTftAddrHt9050_St02();  if(HSys.BinDisCtrl!=NULL && HSys.BinDisCtrl->slBinDispLog!=NULL)   //AI(W906-TFT9050) 20261006: HT9050 TFT unit -> address map (end of this file; other machines golden), same line
             HSys.BinDisCtrl->slBinDispLog->Path=as9045LogPath+"\\BinDisplayLog";   // [W906] (6): golden literal unless the ctest seam is set
         std::printf("[ST02-C14] bin display: NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE=%d, BinDisCtrl=%s, ports %s / %s (%s)\n",
                     NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE, HSys.BinDisCtrl ? "TMyBinDispHT9046" : "(none)",
@@ -822,3 +822,27 @@ unsigned long W906_BinDispRealPortProbes_St02()
 {
     return g_realProbes;
 }
+
+//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+//AI(W906-TFT9050) 20261006: EastSun 1006「我需要TFT 更改9050 分支 第二個到第4個 TFT 是AUTO1~AUTO3 第五個是empty COLOR 先掠過」.
+//  golden addresses unit index i at iAddArrayTFT[i] (MyBinDisp.cpp :790, every TFT frame and reply check reads it forward;
+//  nothing searches it backwards), i.e. 0x20 Loader, 0x21 Empty, 0x22 Color, 0x23 Auto1, 0x24 Auto2, 0x25 Auto3 ...
+//  The HT9050's five TFT units answer at 0x20..0x24 (measured 20261006, ReadVersion_TFT on COM1 9600) and are wired
+//      0x20 Loader   0x21 Auto1   0x22 Auto2   0x23 Auto3   0x24 Empty        (no Color unit)
+//  so on Type_HT9050 with NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE 4 the table becomes Empty=0x24, Auto1=0x21, Auto2=0x22, Auto3=0x23, and Color=0x25
+//  (no unit answers there: golden's GetStatus times it out and marks it not installed -- "skipped"; Color is index 2, outside
+//  golden's i>=3 "not installed = error" check, so it adds no error).  Every other index and every other machine: golden.
+//  Called once from W906_BinDispSystemModularBoot_St02 (before the first Timer1 pass); idempotent.
+void W906_BinDispTftAddrHt9050_St02()
+{
+    extern int iAddArrayTFT[];
+    if(NUMBER_PANEL_TYPE!=4 || MachineTypeChoice!=Type_HT9050)
+        return;
+    iAddArrayTFT[eBinDispEmpty]=0x24;
+    iAddArrayTFT[eBinDispColor]=0x25;
+    iAddArrayTFT[eBinDispAuto1]=0x21;
+    iAddArrayTFT[eBinDispAuto2]=0x22;
+    iAddArrayTFT[eBinDispAuto3]=0x23;
+    std::printf("[TFT9050] HT9050 TFT map: Loader 0x20, Auto1 0x21, Auto2 0x22, Auto3 0x23, Empty 0x24, Color skipped (0x25)\n");
+    std::fflush(stdout);
+}
